{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图文对齐与生成式 VLM：开放语义不等于视觉事实</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Vision-Language Models</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_038_biomedclip-title\">BiomedCLIP</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">以 PMC-15M 广域生物医学 figure–caption 语料、ViT 视觉塔和 PubMedBERT 文本塔训练领域 CLIP。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Domain-specific CLIP trained on PMC-15M (15 million biomedical figure–caption pairs from PubMed Central) using a ViT vision tower and PubMedBERT text tower.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">生物医学图像/论文图与对应 caption</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Biomedical image (radiology, pathology, microscopy, chart) + scientific figure caption</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">开放词汇生物医学图文共享嵌入</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Open-vocabulary biomedical multimodal embeddings for retrieval, zero-shot classification, and VQA</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1(c) and 1(d) · PDF p.15</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.00915\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_038_biomedclip')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_038_biomedclip')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"BiomedCLIP original paper architecture figure, Figure 1(c) and 1(d)\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/5b79108d2a71fc1f0ae2.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1(c) and 1(d) · PDF p.15</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_038_biomedclip', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_038_biomedclip\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_038_biomedclip')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_038_biomedclip', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_038_biomedclip\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生物医学图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">来自论文的显微、放射、病理、图表等多样视觉内容。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests biomedical image (radiology, pathology, microscopy, chart) + scientific figure caption and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"来自论文的显微、放射、病理、图表等多样视觉内容。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests biomedical image (radiology, pathology, microscopy, chart) + scientific figure caption and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"生物医学图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_038_biomedclip', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">生物医学图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">来自论文的显微、放射、病理、图表等多样视觉内容。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests biomedical image (radiology, pathology, microscopy, chart) + scientific figure caption and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"视觉 Transformer 将图像 patch 汇聚为全局向量。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes ViT Image Tower to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"ViT Image Tower\" data-node-name-en=\"ViT Image Tower\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_038_biomedclip', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>ViT Image Tower</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">视觉 Transformer 将图像 patch 汇聚为全局向量。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes ViT Image Tower to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"视觉向量投影并归一化到共享嵌入空间。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs projection within the core biomedical figure caption dual tower computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"图像投影\" data-node-name-en=\"projection\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_038_biomedclip', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">图像投影</span><span class=\"lang-en\">projection</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">视觉向量投影并归一化到共享嵌入空间。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs projection within the core biomedical figure caption dual tower computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"与 figure 配对的生物医学描述包含实体、模态和实验语境。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Caption within the core biomedical figure caption dual tower computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"论文 Caption\" data-node-name-en=\"Caption\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_038_biomedclip', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">论文 Caption</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Caption</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">与 figure 配对的生物医学描述包含实体、模态和实验语境。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Caption within the core biomedical figure caption dual tower computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"领域语言 encoder 处理生物医学术语和论文句法。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs PubMedBERT Tower within the core biomedical figure caption dual tower computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"PubMedBERT Tower\" data-node-name-en=\"PubMedBERT Tower\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_038_biomedclip', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>PubMedBERT Tower</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">领域语言 encoder 处理生物医学术语和论文句法。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs PubMedBERT Tower within the core biomedical figure caption dual tower computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"caption 向量投影并归一化到视觉同一空间。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs projection within the core biomedical figure caption dual tower computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"文本投影\" data-node-name-en=\"projection\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_038_biomedclip', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">文本投影</span><span class=\"lang-en\">projection</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">caption 向量投影并归一化到视觉同一空间。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs projection within the core biomedical figure caption dual tower computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在 PMC-15M batch 内进行图像↔caption 双向对比。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies symmetric CLIP Loss to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"对称 CLIP Loss\" data-node-name-en=\"symmetric CLIP Loss\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_038_biomedclip', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">对称 CLIP Loss</span><span class=\"lang-en\">symmetric CLIP Loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在 PMC-15M batch 内进行图像↔caption 双向对比。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies symmetric CLIP Loss to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"以文本 prompt 做零样本分类，或用于检索和下游适配。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces open-vocabulary biomedical multimodal embeddings for retrieval, zero-shot classification, and vqa via Open-Vocabulary Embedding.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"开放词汇嵌入\" data-node-name-en=\"Open-Vocabulary Embedding\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_038_biomedclip', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">开放词汇嵌入</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Open-Vocabulary Embedding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">以文本 prompt 做零样本分类，或用于检索和下游适配。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces open-vocabulary biomedical multimodal embeddings for retrieval, zero-shot classification, and vqa via Open-Vocabulary Embedding.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"BiomedCLIP Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · BiomedCLIP 以领域文本 prompt 构造零样本分类器</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Broad-Coverage Biomedical Figure–Caption Contrastive Alignment</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"BiomedCLIP：核心公式 · BiomedCLIP 以领域文本 prompt 构造零样本分类器\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"38\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"34.695945pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-69.028346 -68.957464 251.653967 34.695945\" width=\"251.653967pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M2.85475 0V-.108683C2.282351-.115929 2.166422-.188385 2.166422-.536171V-4.883507L2.108458-4.897998L.8042