5\" width=\"17.414493\" x=\"74.897969\" y=\"-51.915318\"></rect><use x=\"75.296475\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g10-106\" y=\"-42.241618\"></use><use x=\"77.936568\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g10-80\" y=\"-42.241618\"></use><use x=\"85.028483\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g16-58\" y=\"-40.747238\"></use><use x=\"89.921462\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g10-106\" y=\"-42.241618\"></use><use x=\"98.381637\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g4-213\" y=\"-59.270229\"></use><use x=\"95.932009\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g16-63\" y=\"-37.429661\"></use><use x=\"100.80837\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g7-50\" y=\"-37.429661\"></use><use x=\"105.761082\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g7-80\" y=\"-37.429661\"></use><use x=\"110.945841\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g13-58\" y=\"-36.296855\"></use><use x=\"118.169349\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g19-53\" y=\"-49.075975\"></use><use x=\"121.03859\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g23-80\" y=\"-47.581594\"></use><use x=\"125.082227\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g23-117\" y=\"-47.581594\"></use><use x=\"128.718592\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g23-98\" y=\"-47.581594\"></use><use x=\"132.354957\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g23-77\" y=\"-47.581594\"></use><use x=\"138.820414\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g23-101\" y=\"-47.581594\"></use><use x=\"142.049508\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g23-100\" y=\"-47.581594\"></use><use x=\"145.685873\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g23-66\" y=\"-47.581594\"></use><use x=\"150.536783\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g23-69\" y=\"-47.581594\"></use><use x=\"154.980421\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g23-82\" y=\"-47.581594\"></use><use x=\"159.576777\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g23-84\" y=\"-47.581594\"></use><use x=\"165.016619\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g10-185\" y=\"-49.075975\"></use><use x=\"169.459952\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g19-63\" y=\"-49.075975\"></use><use x=\"174.839777\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g10-186\" y=\"-49.075975\"></use><use x=\"178.655453\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g4-170\" y=\"-54.625157\"></use><use x=\"178.655453\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g4-174\" y=\"-48.647573\"></use><use x=\"178.655453\" xlink:href=\"#m038_g4-172\" y=\"-34.261519\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">既有医学 CLIP 多局限于胸片单一模态</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Prior medical CLIP models were restricted to single modalities (mostly chest X-rays) and lacked broad biomedical taxonomy coverage.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在 PMC-15M 科学 figure-caption pairs 上训练 ViT 与 PubMedBERT 双编码器</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Harvest 15M diverse biomedical figure–caption pairs from PMC open-access articles and train a ViT + PubMedBERT dual encoder with long context.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">扩大到多类生物医学图像和专科文本的开放预训练</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Large-scale multi-specialty biomedical corpus (PMC-15M) + domain-specific PubMedBERT text encoder + patch-dropout scaling.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用于跨模态检索、zero-shot 分类和 VQA</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Widely used open-weight backbone for cross-modality biomedical retrieval, zero-shot triage, and VQA initialization.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">开放权重且覆盖广；科学 figure 与真实 DICOM 分布仍不同</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Broadest open biomedical CLIP model; scientific publication figures differ in resolution and calibration from raw clinical DICOMs.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">把 PubMed 论文 figure–caption 天然配对扩展为跨模态预训练数据，而不局限单一临床数据集。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">领域语言 encoder 与视觉 encoder 在统一归一化空间中通过对称对比目标共同更新。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">文本 prompt 定义任务标签，使同一模型可跨多类生物医学视觉任务复用。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Harvest 15M diverse biomedical figure–caption pairs from PMC open-access articles and train a ViT + PubMedBERT dual encoder with long context.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Large-scale multi-specialty biomedical corpus (PMC-15M) + domain-specific PubMedBERT text encoder + patch-dropout scaling.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Broad-Coverage Biomedical Figure–Caption Contrastive Alignment.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">PMC-15M 覆盖广但论文插图包含面板、箭头和合成图表，与原始临床影像分布不同。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">零样本结果要按模态、机构和 label wording 分层评估，避免把学术 caption 偏差带入临床判断。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Widely used open-weight backbone for cross-modality biomedical retrieval, zero-shot triage, and VQA initialization.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Broadest open biomedical CLIP model; scientific publication figures differ in resolution and calibration from raw clinical DICOMs.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1056/AIoa2400640\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>BiomedCLIP: a multimodal biomedical foundation model pretrained from fifteen million scientific image-text pairs</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/microsoft/BiomedCLIP-PubMedBERT_256-vit_base_patch16_224\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
